# Uninvited Guests (otherAreas 81): Monarch Linn's 32001 while the quest is completed (the section's second status).
# CoP Slanderous Utterings current. Accepted at Prog 1 with the permit (GMs): the battlefield entered; inside, the quest
# set completed (a GM); won: 32001 (the cutscene skippable), finished: Prog 2 all the same.
lists TavnazianSafehold/Justinius/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/572 MonarchLinn/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=MonarchLinn pos=-37.6,-3.35,-540 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop SlanderousUtterings current
quest OtherAreas.UninvitedGuests accepted
charvar Quest[4][81]Prog 1
keyitem MonarchLinnPatrolPermit
login
trigger SD_Entrance                     # the permit, Prog 1: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=97                  # index 6, area 1
finish                                  # in the arena; the permit spent
quest OtherAreas.UninvitedGuests completed # a GM, inside
bfwin                                   # won: 32001
finish                                  # completed: Prog 2
